            practicalApplicationsEn = "1. Cast anxious thoughts onto the Lord in prayer.\n2. Fix your thoughts on Christ instead of worldly turmoil (Isa 26:3).\n3. Pursue reconciliation as a peacemaker in your community.\n4. Guard what enters your mind through media and conversation.",
