            detailedExplanationEn = "Isaiah 58 describes the true fast that pleases God: breaking the bonds of wickedness, undoing heavy burdens, letting the oppressed go free, and feeding the hungry. Fasting humbles the soul and intensifies spiritual sensitivity.",
